description: "\"guarantees[5]: Composable Cognition,Explainable Thinking,Deterministic Execution,Traceable Reasoning,Reusable Cognitive Primitives\""
spec:
  id: atomic_operations
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Cognitive Foundation
  description: "\"\\\"Defines the Atomic Cognitive Operations (ACO) that form the fundamental computational units of engineering thought. Every reasoning process, debugging session, architectural decision, code review and engineering judgement is composed from these primitive cognitive operations.\\\"\""
purpose: Define the smallest indivisible engineering thinking operations.
success: Every engineering reasoning process decomposes into atomic cognitive operations.
